# API-03 the migration on data a released build wrote (autobyteus-661 T-3; AC-011, REQ-012, D-3, D-4)
# Released: image autobyteus/autobyteus-server:beta = server package 1.5.14-beta.7 (local image 8c29c938dec1; not pulled or retagged). Three nodes a, b, c on test-owned named volumes 661-api-rel-{a,b,c}-data, started as the public launcher does (-e AUTOBYTEUS_SERVER_HOST=http://localhost:<port>, -p 127.0.0.1:<port>:8000); owner credentials by setup code + exchange (kept in a 0600 file, deleted).
